## Why attribution and not share-alike

`spec/09-open-questions.md` D13 originally proposed CC BY-SA 4.0. It was
changed to CC BY 4.0 for one reason specific to this project: D14 records
that **the spec files are the scripts for the series**, so the most
important works derived from this prose are videos. Share-alike would
place an unresolved copyleft question over them. Attribution gets the
credit requirement with none of that exposure.
